Package: containerd-opencontainers
Version: v2.0.0-beta.0+git0+b1624c3628-r0.38
Description: containerd is a daemon to control runC
 containerd is a daemon to control runC, built for performance and
 density.                containerd leverages runC's advanced features
 such as seccomp and user namespace                support as well as
 checkpoint and restore for cloning and live migration of containers.
Section: base
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OE-Core Developers <openembedded-core@lists.openembedded.org>
License: Apache-2.0
Architecture: aarch64
OE: containerd-opencontainers
Homepage: https://github.com/containerd/containerd
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39+git5+e8f5217097), virtual-runc
Provides: virtual-containerd
Source: containerd-opencontainers_git.bb
